Package: irpanel
Title: Impact-Region Socioeconomic Panels for CIL 2.0
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("CIL", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "s.cadavid1587@gmail.com")
Description: A clean, optimized R pipeline that builds impact-region
    socioeconomic panels (income, population, age cohorts) for CIL 2.0.
    Reuses the logic of the climate_compensation "book" pipeline and the
    Carleton et al. (2022) legacy pipeline, with two deliberate deltas:
    (1) population scaled to UN WPP instead of IIASA-WiC, and (2) the sum of
    regional GDP forced to match country GDP. Orchestrated with {targets}.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
